# ==========================================
# HITL Experiment Scenario - Difficulty tier 4/5: HARD
# Four conflict trials in two clusters. Within each cluster the two
# conflicts are timed only ~20s apart, so both are live and alerting
# at the same time - real split-attention pressure, twice per run.
# ==========================================

# --- System & Camera Initialization ---
00:00:00.00> CDMETHOD ON
00:00:00.00> PLUGIN LOAD HITL_CONFLOG
00:00:00.00> FOVACLOG ON
00:00:00.00> OPCMDLOG ON
00:00:00.00> HITLCONFLOG ON
00:00:00.00> HEARTBEATLOG ON
00:00:00.00> SAVEIC HITL_4con_run
00:00:00.00> PAN 52.0 4.5
00:00:00.00> ZOOM 0.7

# --- Background Traffic ---
# Eight aircraft, FL240-FL350 - clear of the FL100/150/180/190 used by
# the four trials below.
00:00:00.00> CRE BG1, B738, 52.8, 3.3, 090, FL240, 300
00:00:00.00> CRE BG2, A320, 51.1, 5.6, 270, FL260, 300
00:00:00.00> CRE BG3, B744, 52.6, 4.9, 180, FL300, 350
00:00:00.00> CRE BG4, MD11, 51.4, 3.7, 360, FL280, 280
00:00:00.00> CRE BG5, A319, 51.2, 4.9, 045, FL250, 290
00:00:00.00> CRE BG6, B772, 52.7, 4.0, 225, FL320, 320
00:00:00.00> CRE BG7, A333, 51.6, 3.4, 070, FL270, 300
00:00:00.00> CRE BG8, B789, 52.9, 5.0, 200, FL350, 320

# ==========================================
# Cluster 1 (t~00:00:45-00:01:05)
# ==========================================

# Trial 1: Head-On Conflict (180 deg dpsi) @ FL100
# Meets at (52.0000N, 4.5000E) at t=00:00:45.
00:00:00.00> CRE TARG1, B738, 52.0000, 4.4154, 090, FL100, 250
00:00:15.00> CRE INTRUDER1, B738, 52.0000, 4.5564, 270, FL100, 250

# Trial 2: Crossing Conflict (90 deg dpsi) @ FL150
# Meets at (51.6000N, 5.0000E) at t=00:01:05 - only 20s after trial 1's
# meeting time, so both are live together for a stretch.
00:00:25.00> CRE TARG2, A320, 51.5537, 5.0000, 360, FL150, 250
00:00:25.00> CRE INTRUDER2, A320, 51.6000, 4.9248, 090, FL150, 250

# ==========================================
# Cluster 2 (t~00:02:00-00:02:20)
# ==========================================

# Trial 3: Crossing Conflict (90 deg dpsi) @ FL180
# Meets at (51.9000N, 4.0000E) at t=00:02:00.
00:01:20.00> CRE TARG3, A319, 51.8759, 3.9323, 060, FL180, 260
00:01:20.00> CRE INTRUDER3, A319, 51.8583, 4.0391, 330, FL180, 260

# Trial 4: Head-On Conflict (180 deg dpsi) @ FL190
# Meets at (52.1000N, 4.9000E) at t=00:02:20 - only 20s after trial 3's
# meeting time. Total runtime (~00:02:20) is deliberately longer than
# tier 3's but still comfortably under the 3-minute cap - that's saved
# for tier 5, the hardest one.
00:01:50.00> CRE TARG4, B738, 52.1000, 4.8436, 090, FL190, 250
00:01:50.00> CRE INTRUDER4, B738, 52.1000, 4.9564, 270, FL190, 250
